      "type": "passage",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "        If it do come to pass\n        That any man turn ass,\n        Leaving his wealth and ease\n        A stubborn will to please,\n    Ducdame, ducdame, ducdame;\n        Here shall he see\n        Gross fools as he,\n    An if he will come to me.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
