      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "JAQUES.\n’Tis a Greek invocation to call fools into a circle. I’ll go sleep if I can; if I cannot, I’ll rail against all the first-born of Egypt.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
